nek a technikának a",params:[]),(code:20110,indent:0,string:"lényege?\"",params:[]),(code:10130,indent:0,string:"",params:[0,0,0]),(code:10110,indent:0,string:"Cyrus",params:[]),(code:20110,indent:0,string:"\"Az azonnali ölés.\"",params:[]),(code:10110,indent:0,string:"Cyrus",params:[]),(code:20110,indent:0,string:"\"Ezzel a támadással bárkit egy csapással",params:[]),(code:20110,indent:0,string:"megölhetsz.\"",params:[]),(code:10110,indent:0,string:"Cyrus",params:[]),(code:20110,indent:0,string:"\"A módszer a következő...\"",params:[]),(code:11010,indent:0,string:"",params:[0]),(code:11410,indent:0,string:"",params:[30]),(code:11020,indent:0,string:"",params:[0]),(code:10130,indent:0,string:"Ron",params:[6,0,0]),(code:10110,indent:0,string:"\\N[1]",params:[]),(code:20110,indent:0,string:"\"... és a pengéket oldalirányban",params:[]),(code:20110,indent:0,string:"széthúzni.\"",params:[]),(code:10130,indent:0,string:"",params:[0,0,0]),(code:10110,indent:0,string:"Cyrus",params:[]),(code:20110,indent:0,string:"\"Pontosan.\"",params:[]),(code:10110,indent:0,string:"Cyrus",params:[]),(code:20110,indent:0,string:"\"Gyorsan tanulsz. Mi is a neved?\"",params:[]),(code:10130,indent:0,string:"Ron",params:[7,0,0]),(code:10110,indent:0,string:"\\N[1]",params:[]),(code:20110,indent:0,string:"\"\\N[1].\"",params:[]),(code:10130,indent:0,string:"",params:[0,0,0]),(code:10110,indent:0,string:"Cyrus",params:[]),(code:20110,indent:0,string:"\"Sok sikert a továbbiakban.\"",params:[]),(code:10130,indent:0,string:"Ron",params:[7,0,0]),(code:10110,indent:0,string:"\\N[1]",params:[]),(code:20110,indent:0,string:"\"Kösz.\"",params:[]),(code:10130,indent:0,string:"",params:[0,0,0]),(code:10110,indent:0,string:"Cyrus",params:[]),(code:20110,indent:0,string:"\"Ki tudja, legközelebb majd te tanítasz",params:[]),(code:20110,indent:0,string:"meg engem valamire...\"",params:[]),(code:11550,indent:0,string:"Item",params:[90,100,50]),(code:10110,indent:0,string:"\\N[1] megtanulta a \'Gyilkos pengé\